# Raw, unoptimised hero source models are held OUT of git — a 20 MB GLB would
# bloat history permanently (there is no Git LFS here) and is far too heavy for
# runtime. Commit only OPTIMISED derivatives (target < 2 MB, see ../README.md).
chameleon-base.glb

# Allow optimised/derivative models to be committed:
!chameleon-optimised.glb
